    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Host, you and your friends will play as prisoners who have been invited to participate in the &quot;show.&quot; There will be 5 games that will test your bravery, stealth skills, intelligence, and resistance to criticism. The Host will comment on everything and guide you throughout the whole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703720/extras/a1ce5befffcabfef7386aa052be14c91.poster.avif?t=1751969309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703720/extras/a1ce5befffcabfef7386aa052be14c91.webm?t=1751969309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be several scenarios with completely different gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Game:</strong><br>You will need to find and activate terminals in a huge abandoned factory. Monsters \u2014 and even your friends \u2014 will try to prevent you from activating them all. Your only tool will be a flashlight, which you must recharge at special stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second Game:</strong><br>You will be placed in a large labyrinth that you must escape first. Lockers for hiding, a shotgun for defense, lurking monsters, and cold concrete walls \u2014 that's all you have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third Game:</strong><br>Here, you'll discover who is the &quot;dumbest&quot; among your group. A large set of logical and general knowledge questions will determine the winner \u2014 and the loser.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth Game:</strong><br>Things get a bit more interesting. You'll search for valuable items hidden among mountains of trash in another abandoned location. Monsters will be present again, but this time their behavior will be different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifth Game:</strong><br>Currently in development. We will update this text as soon as the fifth game is completed.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Host, you and your friends will play as prisoners who have been invited to participate in the &quot;show.&quot; There will be 5 games that will test your bravery, stealth skills, intelligence, and resistance to criticism. The Host will comment on everything and guide you throughout the whole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703720/extras/a1ce5befffcabfef7386aa052be14c91.poster.avif?t=1751969309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703720/extras/a1ce5befffcabfef7386aa052be14c91.webm?t=1751969309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be several scenarios with completely different gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Game:</strong><br>You will need to find and activate terminals in a huge abandoned factory. Monsters \u2014 and even your friends \u2014 will try to prevent you from activating them all. Your only tool will be a flashlight, which you must recharge at special stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second Game:</strong><br>You will be placed in a large labyrinth that you must escape first. Lockers for hiding, a shotgun for defense, lurking monsters, and cold concrete walls \u2014 that's all you have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third Game:</strong><br>Here, you'll discover who is the &quot;dumbest&quot; among your group. A large set of logical and general knowledge questions will determine the winner \u2014 and the loser.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth Game:</strong><br>Things get a bit more interesting. You'll search for valuable items hidden among mountains of trash in another abandoned location. Monsters will be present again, but this time their behavior will be different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifth Game:</strong><br>Currently in development. We will update this text as soon as the fifth game is completed.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Host is a multiplayer horror game where you and up to three friends compete to find out who is the most fearless, smart and agile. You play as prisoners taking part in a show that inculdes five different games.",
